Package: campus-network
Version: 2.1.0
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), curl, systemd, ca-certificates
Maintainer: campus-network contributors
Homepage: https://github.com/fsfgrafb/campus-network
Description: Persistent Ruijie ePortal campus network connection manager
 A lightweight systemd service and command-line client with automatic recovery,
 persistent on/off mode, bounded exponential backoff and local user control.
